# GPUI UI consistency

Follow `flowy18_wip/DESIGN.md`.

Critical: GPUI `overflow_hidden` clips rectangles only, not corner radii. Opaque children that sit on a rounded edge must set matching `rounded_t` / `rounded_b` / `rounded_l` / `rounded_r` (modals use `theme.modal_radius()`).

Popup shells use `flowy_ui::modal_layer` + `flowy_ui::dialog` + `modal_radius`. Do not invent one-off modal radii.
